{
    "name": "synthetic-agent-unavailable",
    "description": "synthetic: a 200 whose meta.stopped_reason is agent_unavailable, for a phone plus research-field request. The research runtime was down, so the research field answers as an abstention while the standard lane still ran and returned the phone value. VOYGR settles the standard lane alone: 1 credit, not the 2 the estimate quotes. Body written from the shape of the real mixed answers and the backend's settle, not recorded: the state cannot be induced on demand.",
